From 40683d085c4f47ed0037fd751c98a19de3ee9a72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quinn <coderquinn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:21:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(access): require a fresh Test Profile registration after
 Network Service loss

When a private Context is lost, retire every unauthenticated test listener registration instead of letting the replacement Context install it. The controller revokes the old core and, only after confirmed retirement, admits one cold restore from the saved Profile binding. Adding a factory to a live Context keeps the registration. Explicit revocation keeps restore closed.
---
